msgid "Multireference local correlation methods (PNO-CASPT2)"
msgstr "多参考局域相关方法（PNO-CASPT2）"

msgid "Single-state PNO-CASPT2"
msgstr "单态PNO-CASPT2"

msgid ""
"Many default settings for local approximations are similar to `default "
"settings in PNO-LMP2 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#default-and-"
"tight-settings>`__."
msgstr ""
"许多局域近似的默认设置与\\ `PNO-LMP2中的默认设置 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#default-and-"
"tight-settings>`__\\ 类似。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "PNO-CASPT2 specific options"
msgstr "PNO-CASPT2特定选项"

msgid ""
"``FCLOS`` (default: *false*) use closed-shell Fock matrix :math:`f^c` in the"
" right-hand side of the PNO-CASPT2 amplitude equations. Recommended if an "
"averaged Fock matrix is used in the zero-order Hamiltonian"
msgstr ""
"``FCLOS``\\ （默认值：\\ *false*\\ ）在 PNO-CASPT2 振幅方程的右侧使用闭壳层 Fock 矩阵 "
":math:`f^c`\\ 。如果在零级哈密顿量中使用平均 Fock 矩阵，则推荐使用此选项"

msgid ""
"``SHIFT`` (default: *0.0*) level shift to reduce the intruder state problem "
"(see `level shifts in RS2 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#level-"
"shifts>`__)"
msgstr ""
"``SHIFT``\\ （默认值：\\ *0.0*\\ ）用于减轻入侵态问题的能级位移（参见 `RS2 中的能级位移 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#level-"
"shifts>`__\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``CIREC`` record for CASSCF CI vectors stored in ``MULTI``. If given, these "
"are used without performing an extra reference CI. The CI vectors have to be"
" saved in multi using the ``save,cirec`` directive (see examples below)."
msgstr ""
"``CIREC`` 存储在 ``MULTI`` 中的 CASSCF CI 向量记录。如果提供，则直接使用这些向量而无需执行额外的参考 CI。CI "
"向量必须使用 ``save,cirec`` 指令保存在 multi 中（参见下面的示例）。"

msgid ""
"``USE_SINGLES`` (default: *0*) if set to 1 explicit single excitations are "
"used in the amplitude equations"
msgstr "``USE_SINGLES``\\ （默认值：\\ *0*\\ ）如果设置为 1，则在振幅方程中使用显式单激发"

msgid ""
"``DIAG_DENF`` (default: *1*) the Gamma matrix is diagonalized in PNO-CASPT2 "
"(makes H0 block-diagonal)"
msgstr "``DIAG_DENF``\\ （默认值：\\ *1*\\ ）在PNO-CASPT2中对Gamma矩阵进行对角化（使H0成为块对角矩阵）"

msgid ""
"``THRDLP`` threshold for projection of redundant configurations in P1 and P0"
" subspaces"
msgstr "``THRDLP`` P1和P0子空间中冗余构型投影的阈值"

msgid ""
"``THRDLS`` threshold for projection of redundant configurations in the "
"remaining configuration subspaces"
msgstr "``THRDLS`` 其余构型子空间中冗余构型投影的阈值"

msgid ""
"Using the directive ``STATE`` one can specify the state of interest (see "
"`the single-root excited state calculation in RS2 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#excited-"
"state-calculations>`__)."
msgstr ""
"使用指令\\ ``STATE``\\ 可以指定感兴趣的态（参见\\ `RS2中的单根激发态计算 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#excited-"
"state-calculations>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "Multi-state PNO-CASPT2"
msgstr "多态PNO-CASPT2"

msgid ""
"Multi-state calculations are possible by specifying multiple states on the "
"``STATE`` card."
msgstr "通过在\\ ``STATE``\\ 卡片上指定多个态，可以进行多态计算。"

msgid "Additional options"
msgstr "附加选项"

msgid ""
"``H0`` (default: *0*) use CASPT2\\ **D** (*=1*) or CASPT2\\ **D2** (*=2*) "
"approximations (see `J. Chem. Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.5097644>`__ "
"**150**, 214107 (2019))"
msgstr ""
"``H0``\\ （默认值：\\ *0*\\ ）使用 CASPT2\\ **D**\\ （\\ *=1*\\ ）或 CASPT2\\ **D2**\\ "
"（\\ *=2*\\ ）近似（参见 `J. Chem. Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.5097644>`__ "
"**150**, 214107 (2019)）"

msgid ""
"``COUPCOR`` (default: *0*) use coupling corrections for the above "
"approximations (*1*: simple Lagrangian correction **Dc** or **D2c**; *2*: "
"additional relaxation correction **Dcr** or **D2cr**)"
msgstr ""
"``COUPCOR``\\ （默认值：\\ *0*\\ ）对上述近似使用耦合校正（\\ *1*\\ ：简单的拉格朗日校正 **Dc** 或 "
"**D2c**\\ ；\\ *2*\\ ：额外的弛豫校正 **Dcr** 或 **D2cr**\\ ）"

msgid "Bibliography"
msgstr "参考文献"

msgid "PNO-CASPT2:"
msgstr "PNO-CASPT2："

msgid "Multi-state PNO-CASPT2:"
msgstr "多态 PNO-CASPT2："

msgid ""
"In this section multireference local correlation methods are described. Many"
" keywords are similar to :doc:`PNO-based single-reference methods "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>` and :doc:`RS2 "
"methods <multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory>`. The "
"corresponding publications can be found in `#bibliography "
"<multireference_local_correlation_methods_pno-caspt2.html#bibliography>`__"
msgstr ""
"本节介绍多参考局域相关方法。许多关键字与 :doc:`基于PNO的单参考方法 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>` 和 :doc:`RS2方法 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory>` 类似。相应的出版物可在 "
"`#bibliography <multireference_local_correlation_methods_pno-"
"caspt2.html#bibliography>`__ 中找到。"

msgid ""
"In order to avoid an expensive canonical integral transformation and the "
"storage of the resulting integrals (which can be huge for large molecules), "
"it is necessary to store the CASSCF wavefunction(s) using the ``CIREC`` "
"option, see `Saving the CI vectors <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-"
"ci-vectors>`__. The same ``CIREC`` option must be given on the "
"``PNO_CASPT2`` command line. Note that the record number is automatically "
"increased by 100 for each ``WF`` directive (i.e. different spatial or spin "
"symmetry) in the CASSCF program (Multi). An example is given below."
msgstr ""
"为了避免昂贵的正则积分变换以及存储由此产生的积分（对于大分子而言可能非常庞大），有必要使用 ``CIREC`` 选项存储 CASSCF 波函数，参见 "
"`保存CI向量 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors>`__\\ 。必须在 "
"``PNO_CASPT2`` 命令行中给出相同的 ``CIREC`` 选项。请注意，在 CASSCF 程序（Multi）中，每个 ``WF`` "
"指令（即不同的空间或自旋对称性）的记录号会自动增加100。下面给出一个示例。"

msgid "examples/h2o_pno_caspt2.inp"
msgstr "examples/h2o_pno_caspt2.inp"

msgid "The program can be invoked using **``PNO-CASPT2``, *options***."
msgstr "可以使用 **``PNO-CASPT2``, *\\ options*** 调用该程序。"

msgid ""
"General local correlation options ``IEXT, REXT,THRDIST, FITLMO, LOCFIT_PNO, "
"THRLOC`` can be found in options for `PNO "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#options>`__ "
"or `PAO <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#general-options>`__ "
"based methods."
msgstr ""
"通用局域相关选项 ``IEXT, REXT,THRDIST, FITLMO, LOCFIT_PNO, THRLOC`` 可在基于 `PNO "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#options>`__ "
"或 `PAO <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#general-options>`__ "
"的方法的选项中找到。"

msgid ""
"``THRPNO_EN (default: 0.997) completeness threshold for PNO construction``"
msgstr "``THRPNO_EN（默认值：0.997）PNO 构造的完备性阈值``"

msgid ""
"``THRPNO_OCC (default: 1.D-8) occupation number threshold for PNO "
"construction``"
msgstr "``THRPNO_OCC（默认值：1.D-8）PNO 构造的占据数阈值``"

msgid ""
"``THRPNOP2_EN/THRPNOP1_EN/THRPNOP0_EN (default: THRPNO_EN) as THRPNO_EN, but"
" only for P2/P1/P0 excitation subspace``"
msgstr ""
"``THRPNOP2_EN/THRPNOP1_EN/THRPNOP0_EN（默认值：THRPNO_EN）与 THRPNO_EN 相同，但仅适用于 "
"P2/P1/P0 激发子空间``"

msgid ""
"``THRPNOP2_OCC/THRPNOP1_OCC/THRPNOP0_OCC (default: THRPNO_OCC) as "
"THRPNO_OCC, but only for P2/P1/P0 excitation subspace``"
msgstr ""
"``THRPNOP2_OCC/THRPNOP1_OCC/THRPNOP0_OCC（默认值：THRPNO_OCC）与 THRPNO_OCC "
"相同，但仅适用于 P2/P1/P0 激发子空间``"

msgid ""
"**Note:**  level shifts have to be given as options. The ``SHIFT`` directive"
" refers to denominator shifts, which affect the convergence but not the "
"Hamiltonian and the results."
msgstr "**注意：**\\ 能级位移必须作为选项给出。\\ ``SHIFT`` 指令指的是分母位移，它影响收敛性，但不影响哈密顿量和结果。"

msgid ""
"An effective Hamiltonian \\begin{equation} "
"H_{MN}^\\textrm{eff}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(  \\langle M\\|\\hat H ~^N\\hat "
"T_2\\|N\\rangle + \\langle M \\| ~^M\\hat T_2^{\\dagger} \\hat H \\| "
"N\\rangle\\right) + \\delta_{MN} \\langle M \\| \\hat H \\| N \\rangle. "
"\\end{equation} is constructed using state-specific PNO-CASPT2 amplitudes "
"and diagonalized."
msgstr ""
"使用态特异的 PNO-CASPT2 振幅构造有效哈密顿量 \\begin{equation} "
"H_{MN}^\\textrm{eff}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(  \\langle M\\|\\hat H ~^N\\hat "
"T_2\\|N\\rangle + \\langle M \\| ~^M\\hat T_2^{\\dagger} \\hat H \\| "
"N\\rangle\\right) + \\delta_{MN} \\langle M \\| \\hat H \\| N \\rangle. "
"\\end{equation} 并对其进行对角化。"

